      "side": 1,
      "message": "By default, power button SMI pulse from EC is enabled. Depthcharge can instruct EC to disable this pulse.  However, EC was not honoring that setting after a sysjump here. Hence, we need to ensure that power button is asserted by the EC on sysjump only if power button pulse is not disabled explicitly by AP.",
