      "message": "I guess I\u0027m sorta confused. Does power_button_pulse_enabled control \u0027power button SMI pulse\u0027? And doesn\u0027t set_pwrbtn_to_pch(0,0) assert the power button? Thus, honoring the press but only when it is enabled?",
